00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,300
Found a loose part?
Start with proof, not a guess.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:11,900
In PartSnap, capture the full part,
then the label or molded marking.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:20,300
SplashLens can organize visible clues
and suggest what to check next.

4
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:27,200
Treat any match as possible until you verify the model,
manual, manufacturer guidance, and fitment.

5
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:29,600
Try the workflow at splashlens.com.
